msgid "ambulatory"
msgstr "Ambulatoire (hors établissement)"

# null
#: AMB@definition
msgid "A comprehensive term for health care provided in a healthcare facility (e.g. a practitioneraTMs office, clinic setting, or hospital) on a nonresident basis. The term ambulatory usually implies that the patient has come to the location and is not assigned to a bed. Sometimes referred to as an outpatient encounter."
msgstr ""

