#: PUBLICPOL@definition
msgid "Insurance policy funded by a public health system such as a provincial or national health plan. Examples include BC MSP (British Columbia Medical Services Plan) OHIP (Ontario Health Insurance Plan), NHS (National Health Service)."
msgstr ""

# null
#: WCBPOL
